      "text": "[6:41PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement from UBA Roundabout and NNPC Filling Station towards Cathedral Church, with good traffic flow down to Nitel Intersection.\n\nGood traffic movement from State House, connecting to Force Road.\n\nFaster traffic movement from Zone 2 underneath the bridge towards Flagstaff House, connecting McWen Bridge.\n\nPerfect traffic movement from Onikan Roundabout towards TBS, inward Water Board, connecting Nitel Intersection.\n\nSmooth traffic flow on the entire stretch of Broad Street, from General Hospital towards Tinubu Square, connecting Abibu Oki Street and Martins Junction.\n\nSlow movement approaching Balogun Junction, inward journey from Apongbon.\n\nPerfect traffic movement on the entire stretch of Igbosere Road.\n\nGood traffic movement from Catholic Mission Street, connecting Ganiu Smith Street.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
